      "en": "📖 Real-World Scenario & Context\nSafia maintains branch contact numbers in a Map. Return branch phone number given branch name.\n\n📋 Required Implementation Steps (1 to 5)\n1. Import 'java.util.Map' and 'java.util.HashMap'.\n2. In 'BranchContactBook', declare 'private Map<String, String> branchPhones = new HashMap<>();' and getter.\n3. Implement business method 'getBranchPhone(...)' utilizing 'put()' or 'get()'.\n4. Instantiate 'BranchContactBook' in 'main'.\n5. Print results to console: 'BranchContactBook book = new BranchContactBook();         book.addBranch(\"Chilonzor\", \"+998712001122\");         book.addBranch(\"Oybek\", \"+998712003344\");         System.out.println(\"Oybek telefoni: \" + book.getBranchPhone(\"Oybek\"));'",
