      "en": "📖 Real-World Scenario & Context\nTexnomart tracks branch sales targets. Compute average target across branches using 'map.values()'.\n\n📋 Required Implementation Steps (1 to 5)\n1. Import 'java.util.Map' and 'java.util.HashMap'.\n2. Declare 'private Map<String, Double> branchTargets = new HashMap<>();' and getter in 'SalesTargetPlanner'.\n3. Implement 'calculateAverageTarget(...)' traversing 'entrySet()', 'keySet()' or 'values()'.\n4. Instantiate 'SalesTargetPlanner' in 'main' and populate data.\n5. Print result to console: 'SalesTargetPlanner planner = new SalesTargetPlanner();         planner.setTarget(\"Samarqand\", 120000000.0);         planner.setTarget(\"Buxoro\", 80000000.0);         System.out.println(\"O'rtacha reja: \" + planner.calculateAverageTarget());'",
