      "uz": "📖 Hayotiy Voqealik & Kontekst\nUzum Market xaridori o'zining turli yetkazib berish manzillarini ('home', 'office') saqlashi mumkin. 'Customer' klassida 'Map<String, ShippingAddress> deliveryAddresses = new LinkedHashMap<>();' maydonini boshqaruvchi 'addDeliveryAddress(label, address)' metodini yozing.\n\n📋 Bajarilishi Kerak Bo'lgan Qadamlar (1 dan 5 gacha)\n1. Tegishli yordamchi sinfni (masalan, 'ShippingAddress' yoki boshqa qismni) e'lon qiling.\n2. Asosiy 'Customer' sinfida kolleksiya maydonini private qilib e'lon qiling.\n3. Kolleksiyaga element qo'shuvchi yoki boshqaruvchi 'addDeliveryAddress(...)' metodini yozing.\n4. 'Main' metodida 'Customer' ob'yektini yarating.\n5. Natijani chop eting: 'Customer customer = new Customer(\"Aziz Karimov\");         customer.addDeliveryAddress(\"home\", new ShippingAddress(\"12 Amir Temur\", \"Tashkent\"));         customer.addDeliveryAddress(\"office\", new ShippingAddress(\"5 Mustaqillik\", \"Tashkent\"));         System.out.println(\"Saqlangan manzillar soni: \" + customer.getDeliveryAddresses().size());'",
