      "theoryEn": "Encapsulating collections inside domain entities ensures state validation and prevents external direct mutation.",
      "cleanCode": "class Customer {\n    private Map<String, ShippingAddress> addresses = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n    public void addAddress(String tag, ShippingAddress addr) {\n        addresses.put(tag, addr);\n    }\n}",
